#! Hover across the shapes v0 answers: a function name, a `let` binding whose
#! type is inferred, an expression, and a literal. Ranges are `exact` (the
#! range is behavior); the markdown prose rides the transcript default,
#! because D22 owns hover wording upstream and this repo must not become a
#! second review gate on it.
name      requests/hover
profile   minimal

initialize
open      hello.lu
wait      diagnostics hello.lu
req       hover hello.lu 8:4
req       hover hello.lu 9:9
req       hover hello.lu 10:11
req       hover hello.lu 11:4
shutdown
